      "cooked": "<blockquote><p>Instead, if Invaders Ravage in target land, they damage Invaders in adjacent&nbsp;​lands . . .</p></blockquote><p>This was argued today because it doesn't say \"in an adjacent land\", and the wording sounds like it can go 2 ways:</p><p>1. &nbsp;For each Invader, select an adjacent land for that Invader to Ravage in.</p><p>2. &nbsp;Each Invader Ravages in each adjacent land.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Either way, Thunderspeaker loves that power.</p>",
