      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dpt/{size}/1922_2.png",
      "created_at": "2017-08-08T00:47:10.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>It is number 1. What wording would remove the ambiguity? Remember we also want the Invaders to possibly deal damage in different lands.</p><p>(I believe it's also intended that a single City could kill three Explorers in three different adjacent lands, i.e., splitting up its damage.)</p>",
